UniFi Gateway Emulator for OPNsense.

Emulates a Ubiquiti UniFi Gateway (UGW3 / USG-3P) towards a UniFi controller:
this firewall appears as an adoptable gateway and reports interface counters,
client tables and DPI telemetry to the controller UI.

Web UI: Services > UniFi Gateway
  - service control (start / stop / restart)
  - controller inform/enroll configuration
  - one-click adoption (armed while not enrolled)
